Package: peakpo
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: S.-H. Dan Shim <shdshim@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SHDShim/PeakPo
Description: X-ray diffraction analysis for high pressure science
 PeakPo provides diffraction visualization, JCPDS overlays, peak fitting,
 unit-cell fitting, mapping, sequence analysis, and azimuthal integration.
